What this license covers
- Everything under Art/ except Art/tools/ (the generator is code, MIT):
  concept boards, style sheets, sprite sheets, the generated frames and
  their manifests.
- Every image in the apps' asset catalogs (Apps/**/*.xcassets): bats, eggs,
  portraits, backgrounds and app icons.
- The bat character designs and the Gentle pixel style they are drawn in.
- Frames produced by running Art/tools/gentle_pixel/engine.js on the Batwalk
  part library are derivatives of this artwork and carry the same license.

